motions.motion_text:
WHEREAS ReportACS2026-SI-HSI-0017(the “Report”)recommends Committee and Council receive the audited financial statements of Build Ottawa for the year 2025 in the Annual Report attached as Document 1.
WHEREAS the supporting Document 1 did not originally include theBuild Ottawa 2025 Annual Report and only provided the Audited Consolidated Financial Statements, and;
WHEREAS a new Document 1 has been provided to staff that includes both the Build Ottawa 2025 Annual Report and the Audited Consolidated Financial Statements, and;
WHEREAS an amendment to the Report is required to update the supporting Document 1, and;
THEREFORE BE IT RESOLVED that Planning and Housing Committee amend ReportACS2026-SI-HSI-0017–Item6.1-Build Ottawa 2025 – Annual Report, –Supporting Document 1 - Build Ottawa 2025 Annual Report (including Audited Consolidated Financial Statements).
